body:

<p>Background material accompanying Euclid&rsquo;s <i>Elements</i> — about
the text, about Euclid, references, a quick tour, and a subject
index. The Introduction sits at the
<a href="/">site root</a>, and the
<a href="/geomlib/usingGeomlib.html">Using geomlib diagrams</a>
guide lives under the geomlib section.</p>
